Description:
High-level Rust bindings to the HarfBuzz text shaping engine

Local Modifications:
Updated with tools/import.py rust-harfbuzz (history replayed linearly); how far behind it is: `bun testing/acceptance.ts track`.
The crates (3) live in third_party/rust-harfbuzz/<crate>, one directory per package; their manifests are rewritten by tools/flatten.py
(path dependencies, inlined workspace inheritance, one version per crate). Lockfiles of the upstream are not kept.
Patches: none. Integration fixes: none.
Everything else of the upstream is in third_party/rust-harfbuzz/ unchanged.

